1
00:00:17,266 --> 00:00:19,375
我为什么还要参加这种家庭会议
Why do I still have to come to these family meetings?

2
00:00:19,385 --> 00:00:20,261
我都是成年人了
I'm an adult.

3
00:00:20,261 --> 00:00:21,688
中午才从地下室起床出来的人
She said, emerging from the basement

4
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:22,666
还好意思说这种话
in her pajamas at noon.

5
00:00:22,666 --> 00:00:24,591
别烦我 今天可是周六
Get off my back. It's Saturday.

6
00:00:24,774 --> 00:00:25,997
没错吧
Right?

7
00:00:25,997 --> 00:00:27,586
咱们开会要讨论什么
What is this meeting about?

8
00:00:27,586 --> 00:00:29,349
鸭子回来了吗 如果是的话就太诡异了
Are the ducks back? Cause that was weird.

9
00:00:29,349 --> 00:00:30,306
是他们救了我们
They saved us.

10
00:00:30,306 --> 00:00:31,957
脑子正常的应该都不会这么想吧
From people thinking we're normal.

11
00:00:31,957 --> 00:00:33,179
你们妈妈下周一
Your mom starts her new job

12
00:00:33,179 --> 00:00:34,931
就要正式接管外公的衣柜公司了
running grandpa's closet company on Monday,

13
00:00:34,931 --> 00:00:37,142
你知道她每次遇到大事都会干什么
and you know how she gets when there are big changes.

14
00:00:37,142 --> 00:00:38,650
敲敲门
Knockity-knock!

15
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:39,781
不 千万别
Oh, no. Not --

16
00:00:39,781 --> 00:00:40,789
克拉特沃斯夫人
Mrs. Clutterworth.

17
00:00:40,789 --> 00:00:42,531
谁准备好把家里不用的东西
Who's ready to take everything we don't want

18
00:00:42,531 --> 00:00:43,764
收拾好扔进篮子里
and toss it in the bin?

19
00:00:43,764 --> 00:00:44,833
我准备好了
I am!

20
00:00:44,833 --> 00:00:46,015
你抓手 我抓腿
You get her arms, I'll get her legs.

21
00:00:46,015 --> 00:00:47,981
当孩子们还小的时候
I created Mrs. Clutterworth

22
00:00:47,981 --> 00:00:48,807
我创造了克拉特沃斯夫人这个角色
when the kids were little

23
00:00:48,807 --> 00:00:51,089
好让清理杂物变得有趣一些
as a way to make home organizing fun.

24
00:00:51,089 --> 00:00:53,320
有趣 有趣死了
So fun. Super fun.

25
00:00:53,605 --> 00:00:55,082
或许还有点让人困惑
Maybe a little confusing.

26
00:00:55,082 --> 00:00:55,999
为什么
Why?

27
00:00:56,152 --> 00:00:57,741
你这个名字很明显是改编自
Well, the name is clearly inspired

28
00:00:57,741 --> 00:01:00,053
巴特沃斯夫人[糖浆品牌]
by Mrs. Butterworth, right?

29
00:01:00,064 --> 00:01:02,091
但是说话为什么带英音
But somehow she has a British accent.

30
00:01:02,091 --> 00:01:04,842
因为当时他们很喜欢《欢乐满人间》
Yeah, well, the kids were super into Mary Poppins back then.

31
00:01:04,903 --> 00:01:06,135
还是不理解为什么
Still missing a step.

32
00:01:06,135 --> 00:01:08,468
把这些都拿回自己的房间
Take one of these things up to your rooms.

33
00:01:08,468 --> 00:01:09,456
把你们不用的东西都放进去
Put everything in it you don't use.

34
00:01:09,456 --> 00:01:11,830
我们就不能下周末再做吗 或者永远不做
Can't we just do this next weekend, or, like, never?

35
00:01:11,830 --> 00:01:12,615
不行
No.

36
00:01:12,615 --> 00:01:13,919
我马上就要开始新的工作
I am starting my new job

37
00:01:13,919 --> 00:01:15,976
我想让家里尽可能的整洁
and I want to leave things as organized as possible.

38
00:01:15,976 --> 00:01:18,360
可是大部分人只会把不用的东西扔进柜子里
Most people just throw stuff into a closet.

39
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:20,072
作为衣柜公司的老板
As president of a closet company,

40
00:01:20,072 --> 00:01:20,887
你应该最清楚这点啊
you should know that.

41
00:01:20,887 --> 00:01:22,578
别狡辩了
We're doing this.

42
00:01:22,578 --> 00:01:26,174
何况 如果你们
Or, more to the point, if...

43
00:01:26,174 --> 00:01:28,008
*如果家里有什么东西*
*There's something that you have*

44
00:01:28,008 --> 00:01:29,719
*是你从来不用的*
*And you never, ever use it*

45
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:31,166
*把它放进篮子里*
*Put it in the bin*

46
00:01:31,166 --> 00:01:33,091
*一切都扔扔扔*
*Lose it, lose it, lose it*

47
00:01:33,336 --> 00:01:35,720
我觉得你的理智也已经被你扔掉了
Oh, I think you've lost it, lost it, lost it.

48
00:01:48,709 --> 00:01:51,459
我想在老爸退休的第一天敬他一杯酒
I'd like to toast my dad on his first day of retirement.

49
00:01:51,459 --> 00:01:54,841
祝贺你花了42年在柜里
Congratulations on 42 years in the closet...

50
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:56,257
做生意
business.

51
00:01:56,257 --> 00:01:57,775
我觉得以后最怀念的
I think what I'm going to miss the most

52
00:01:57,775 --> 00:01:59,528
就是那些有关衣柜的笑话了
is all the closet jokes.

53
00:01:59,538 --> 00:02:02,737
一般来说 在这种感性时刻
Traditionally on an occasion this emotionally significant,

54
00:02:02,737 --> 00:02:05,946
主人公都要发表一些感言
the man of the hour delivers a few well-chosen words.

55
00:02:06,801 --> 00:02:08,380
我想告诉你们的是
I would just like to say...

56
00:02:08,971 --> 00:02:09,827
我要去学打高尔夫了
I'm going golfing.

57
00:02:09,827 --> 00:02:11,926
老爸 别忘了莉莉第一场长笛独奏
Dad, don't forget Lily's first flute recital

58
00:02:11,926 --> 00:02:13,026
时间定在周四的三点半
is on Thursday at 3:30.

59
00:02:13,026 --> 00:02:14,432
我很想去给她捧场
I would love to be there,

60
00:02:14,432 --> 00:02:16,316
但是我公司那里走不开
but I'm really swamped at Wo--

61
00:02:16,551 --> 00:02:17,549
这个借口现在不管用了
hell, that snuck up on me.

62
00:02:17,549 --> 00:02:20,055
没事的 外公 我也不想你来
It's okay, Grandpa. I don't want you to come.

63
00:02:20,055 --> 00:02:20,728
我吹得糟透了
I stink.

64
00:02:20,728 --> 00:02:22,398
不 不是的
Hey, no. No.

65
00:02:22,398 --> 00:02:23,631
你才不糟呢
You do not stink.

66
00:02:23,631 --> 00:02:25,220
我不知道为什么她就是这么糟
I don't know why she's so bad.

67
00:02:25,220 --> 00:02:26,871
她明明师出名门啊
She has a great teacher.

68
00:02:26,871 --> 00:02:30,202
我的横笛吹得棒极了
I was a brilliant flautist--

69
00:02:30,253 --> 00:02:31,852
我当时在凡吐拉举办的爵士音乐会上
may have won best new soloist

70
00:02:31,852 --> 00:02:33,941
拿了最佳独奏奖
at the lower Ventura jazz happening.

71
00:02:34,511 --> 00:02:36,875
我以前都把奖杯放在储物柜里
I used to keep my trophy in my locker.

72
00:02:36,905 --> 00:02:39,870
每次那些嫉妒的人把我塞进柜子里
I'd stare at it every time the jealous kids

73
00:02:39,870 --> 00:02:41,306
我都会紧盯着它
would stuff me in there.

74
00:02:42,559 --> 00:02:43,924
祝你今天过得愉快
Hey, have fun today.

75
00:02:43,924 --> 00:02:45,330
你看起来真棒
Nice face candy.

76
00:02:45,789 --> 00:02:46,380
尤其是你的飞行员墨镜
The aviators.

77
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:48,142
你会是高尔夫球场上最帅的
You're gonna be the coolest guy on the golf course.

78
00:02:48,142 --> 00:02:49,130
过来
Hey, come here.

79
00:02:49,558 --> 00:02:51,096
我必须得跟什么人说一下
I'm dying to tell somebody.

80
00:02:51,942 --> 00:02:53,582
我能跟你说个秘密吗
Can I let you in on a little secret?

81
00:02:53,582 --> 00:02:56,465
秘密 就你和我吗
A secret? Just you and me?

82
00:02:56,852 --> 00:02:58,910
抱歉 憋不住那种奸笑 你继续
Sorry, that had to come out. Go on.

83
00:02:58,910 --> 00:03:00,326
我不是去学高尔夫
I'm not going golfing.

84
00:03:00,326 --> 00:03:03,545
我是去学开飞机
I'm taking my first flying lessons today.

85
00:03:03,545 --> 00:03:04,910
我一直想当一个飞行员
I always dreamed of being a pilot.

86
00:03:04,910 --> 00:03:08,517
杰 太棒了 我理解你
Oh, Jay, that's fantastic, and I-I totally get it.

87
00:03:08,517 --> 00:03:09,780
我以前在老家时
I had a crush on the pilot

88
00:03:09,780 --> 00:03:11,074
暗恋过一个开飞机喷农药的人
who flew the crop duster back home.

89
00:03:11,074 --> 00:03:13,580
他有着宽厚的肩膀 低沉沙哑的声音
He had big, broad shoulders and a deep, husky voice

90
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:16,269
现在想想 他可能是因为农药污染才声音沙哑
that, in retrospect, could have been pesticide-related.

91
00:03:16,269 --> 00:03:18,613
不要跟任何人说 尤其是歌洛莉亚
Don't tell anyone, especially Gloria.

92
00:03:18,745 --> 00:03:19,978
我想把这事当成惊喜
I want it to be a surprise.

93
00:03:19,978 --> 00:03:21,496
什么都不说
Not a word.

94
00:03:21,496 --> 00:03:23,003
我不会说的
I'm your man.

95
00:03:23,044 --> 00:03:23,706
你背着一个女士挎包
You're wearing a purse.

96
00:03:23,706 --> 00:03:25,937
这是男士的战术挎包
This is a gentleman's tactical tote.

97
00:03:25,937 --> 00:03:26,671
而且你要知道
And I'll have you know,

98
00:03:26,671 --> 00:03:30,033
这个包的同款被一个海豹六队的人背过
this exact model was carried by a member of Seal Team 6.

99
00:03:30,033 --> 00:03:32,722
是啊 他女朋友试裙子的时候他帮着背过一下
Yes, while his girlfriend tried on dresses.

100
00:03:35,157 --> 00:03:36,502
敲敲门
Knockity-knock!

101
00:03:38,213 --> 00:03:39,344
你们在干什么
What the hell are you doing?

102
00:03:39,344 --> 00:03:42,838
用低廉的价格享受沙龙级的剪发
Getting salon-quality haircuts at a fraction of the price!

103
00:03:42,838 --> 00:03:44,336
谢谢你 阿吸
Thanks, Flowbee!

104
00:03:46,231 --> 00:03:46,984
别闹了
Come on, guys.

105
00:03:46,984 --> 00:03:48,645
你们就没有东西要扔吗
Have you gotten rid of anything today?

106
00:03:48,645 --> 00:03:50,122
都在这里了
Yeah, all that.

107
00:03:50,550 --> 00:03:51,701
就一只袜子吗
That's one sock.

108
00:03:51,701 --> 00:03:53,566
天哪
Oh, my goodness.

109
00:03:53,871 --> 00:03:55,735
我们居然想丢掉它
What in the world were we thinking?

110
00:03:55,827 --> 00:03:57,997
来吧 美女 给我一个吻
Hey, gorgeous! Gimme a kiss!

111
00:03:57,997 --> 00:04:00,758
我可不想让卢克的脏袜子碰到我的嘴
I do not want Luke's dirty sock anywhere near my mouth.

112
00:04:00,758 --> 00:04:01,705
那可不止是脏了
It's seen worse.

113
00:04:01,705 --> 00:04:03,111
太恶心了 不
No. Oh, no.

114
00:04:03,111 --> 00:04:04,354
别闹了 专心一点
Come on, guys. Stay focused.

115
00:04:04,354 --> 00:04:06,453
我不能是这个家里唯一有东西要扔的人
I can't be the only one getting rid of stuff today.

116
00:04:06,453 --> 00:04:09,081
你为什么把阿鸡放进来
Wait a minute. What is Chickie doing in there?

117
00:04:09,081 --> 00:04:09,977
因为它已经坏了
It's broken.

118
00:04:09,977 --> 00:04:11,465
可是当孩子们还小的时候
But every year when the kids were little

119
00:04:11,465 --> 00:04:13,034
他可是复活节的明星
he was the star of Easter!

120
00:04:13,034 --> 00:04:14,511
当然耶稣最受欢迎
I mean, besides Jesus.

121
00:04:14,521 --> 00:04:16,039
当你挤他的时候 他会说
When you squeeze it, it says,

122
00:04:16,049 --> 00:04:17,506
复活节快乐
"Happy Easter!"

123
00:04:17,659 --> 00:04:18,983
现在你挤他 他会说
Now when you squeeze him, he says,

124
00:04:18,983 --> 00:04:22,732
电池液都漏出来啦 让我死了吧
"Battery acid is leaking inside of me. Let me die!"

125
00:04:24,036 --> 00:04:24,953
再见
Later.

126
00:04:25,554 --> 00:04:27,510
她把我最爱的棒子也拿走了
She just took my favorite stick.

127
00:04:27,581 --> 00:04:28,957
管住你的女人
You need to control your woman.

128
00:04:28,957 --> 00:04:31,463
你说的可是你妈
That is your mother you're talking about...

129
00:04:31,524 --> 00:04:32,981
所以我管不住
so that's not happening.

130
00:04:32,981 --> 00:04:33,979
我很爱阿鸡
I love Chickie.

131
00:04:33,979 --> 00:04:35,334
那些东西我都很喜欢
I love all of that stuff!

132
00:04:35,334 --> 00:04:37,229
我知道怎么把它弄回来
And I have a plan to get it back.

133
00:04:37,647 --> 00:04:40,295
但是阿吸可能要不回来了
But maybe we'll let the Flowbee go.

134
00:04:43,097 --> 00:04:43,647
好了
All right.

135
00:04:43,657 --> 00:04:45,379
曼尼 按照你的请求
Manny, as requested,

136
00:04:45,379 --> 00:04:47,447
我带了我最爱的小丑道具
a few of my favorite clown props.

137
00:04:47,447 --> 00:04:48,995
怎么曼尼 你朋友太多[想掉粉]了吗
What's wrong, Manny, you have too many friends?

138
00:04:49,005 --> 00:04:50,309
别听他的
Don't listen to him.

139
00:04:50,309 --> 00:04:52,510
我自告奋勇到乔的学校游园会上表演
I volunteered to perform at Joe's school fair.

140
00:04:52,510 --> 00:04:53,641
我作谢幕表演
I'm closing the show.

141
00:04:53,641 --> 00:04:55,342
起码你进去的时候知道怎么回事
Well, at least you know that going in.

142
00:04:55,342 --> 00:04:57,369
罐中蛇
Okay, Snakes In A Can,

143
00:04:57,461 --> 00:04:58,582
无尽之帕
Endless Handkerchief,

144
00:04:58,582 --> 00:05:01,179
只要你一直拉 它就会一直出来
it will keep coming out of there if you keep pulling it.

145
00:05:01,190 --> 00:05:03,635
当然了 还有喷水小花
And, of course, the Squirting Flower.

146
00:05:04,062 --> 00:05:05,265
太谢谢你了
Thank you so much.

147
00:05:05,295 --> 00:05:06,385
在你把它们拿走之前
Before you take these from me,

148
00:05:06,385 --> 00:05:08,025
要不要先喝一小杯水
would you like a small glass of water?

149
00:05:08,025 --> 00:05:09,513
这是滴水杯吗
Is that a Dribble Glass?

150
00:05:10,318 --> 00:05:11,448
你已经准备好了
You're ready.

151
00:05:11,601 --> 00:05:13,781
不过这罐假的花生糖我还是不拿了
I think I'll pass on the fake peanut brittle, though.

152
00:05:13,781 --> 00:05:15,177
它连幼儿园小孩都骗不了
It's not even fooling preschoolers.

153
00:05:15,177 --> 00:05:16,348
好吧 也行
Okay, maybe.

154
00:05:17,836 --> 00:05:18,906
你好 歌洛莉亚
Oh, hello, Gloria.

155
00:05:18,906 --> 00:05:20,352
谢谢你招待我吃早午餐
Thank you for brunch.

156
00:05:20,352 --> 00:05:23,123
非常 有颠覆性
It was... revolutionary.

157
00:05:23,123 --> 00:05:24,366
是是是 再见
Yes. Goodbye.

158
00:05:24,366 --> 00:05:24,947
这么难讨好
Tough room.

159
00:05:24,947 --> 00:05:26,607
不不 你的领结一直转啊转的
No, no. Your bowtie is very funny

160
00:05:26,607 --> 00:05:28,217
挺好玩的
because it was spinning around,

161
00:05:28,217 --> 00:05:29,867
但是我总是忍不住想起
but I just can't stop thinking about

162
00:05:29,867 --> 00:05:32,149
昨晚做的一个非常可怕的梦
this terrible dream that I had last night.

163
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:33,056
梦见什么了
Oh, what was it?

164
00:05:33,056 --> 00:05:34,380
梦见杰了
It was about Jay.

165
00:05:34,380 --> 00:05:36,723
他从很高的地方坠下来
He was falling from a great height,

166
00:05:36,723 --> 00:05:38,659
而你们俩当时都站在我身边
and you both were by my side,

167
00:05:38,669 --> 00:05:40,768
我很伤心 因为我知道
and I was very sad because I knew that

168
00:05:40,768 --> 00:05:43,121
我再也不能见到他了
I was never, ever going to see him again.

169
00:05:43,824 --> 00:05:45,454
你觉得那意味着什么
What do you think that that means?

170
00:05:45,454 --> 00:05:47,481
我怎么知道 我知道的和你一样多
How would I know? I have all the same information you have.

171
00:05:47,481 --> 00:05:49,641
抱歉 我得打个电话
Excuse me, I need to make a phone call.

172
00:05:50,313 --> 00:05:51,923
我不知道歌洛莉亚做的恶梦
I don't know if Gloria's dreams

173
00:05:51,923 --> 00:05:53,319
会不会像我的一样有预言作用
can predict the future like mine can,

174
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:55,998
但是我知道如果杰遭遇了不测
but I do know that if something happened to Jay...

175
00:05:56,945 --> 00:05:58,769
我自己也活不下去了
I couldn't live with myself.

176
00:05:59,492 --> 00:06:00,654
当然了我也别想活了
Of course, I wouldn't have to,

177
00:06:00,654 --> 00:06:02,599
因为歌洛莉亚会杀了我
because Gloria would kill me.

178
00:06:04,301 --> 00:06:07,051
杰又忘带手机了
Ay, Jay left his phone again.

179
00:06:09,914 --> 00:06:11,075
小卡
Cam.

180
00:06:12,736 --> 00:06:13,979
你为什么给杰打电话
Why are you calling Jay?

181
00:06:13,979 --> 00:06:14,916
是吗
Am I?

182
00:06:15,334 --> 00:06:16,852
我 我以为我给园丁打电话呢
I-I thought I was calling the gardener.

183
00:06:16,852 --> 00:06:18,206
我忘了开院子大门
I forgot to leave the gate open,

184
00:06:18,206 --> 00:06:19,714
所以我可能要回去给他开门了
so I should probably go let him in.

185
00:06:19,714 --> 00:06:22,424
让凯撒再翻一次高墙太残忍了
It'd be cruel to make Caesar climb another big fence.

186
00:06:25,929 --> 00:06:26,825
你知道那个动作吗
You know that maneuver

187
00:06:26,825 --> 00:06:28,679
就是先一飞冲天直到失速
where you fly straight up until you stall

188
00:06:28,679 --> 00:06:30,299
然后俯冲时再抬升的那种
and then pull out of the dive?

189
00:06:30,849 --> 00:06:32,041
我们今天能试试吗
Can we do that today?

190
00:06:32,143 --> 00:06:32,917
不行
Nope.

191
00:06:32,917 --> 00:06:34,761
不用急着决定 我们先升空再说
Don't decide now. We'll talk when we're up.

192
00:06:34,873 --> 00:06:36,147
杰
Hey, Jay!

193
00:06:36,371 --> 00:06:37,970
杰 等一下
Jay, hey, wait up.

194
00:06:38,031 --> 00:06:40,384
你觉得在他到这儿之前我们能起飞吗
Do you think we can take off before he gets here?

195
00:06:41,648 --> 00:06:43,695
在他到这儿之前我们都能飞完着陆了
I think we can land before he gets here.

196
00:06:45,641 --> 00:06:46,935
这是在预先检查吧
So this is a pre-check, right?

197
00:06:46,935 --> 00:06:47,770
我们要检查什么
What are we looking for?

198
00:06:47,770 --> 00:06:48,697
没什么
Nothing.

199
00:06:48,697 --> 00:06:50,134
只是要在那群妞面前耍耍帅
Just trying to look cool for those girls over there.

200
00:06:50,134 --> 00:06:52,324
杰 在你起飞之前我得先跟你谈谈
Jay, I need to talk to you before you fly.

201
00:06:52,324 --> 00:06:53,771
事关生命还有
It's a matter of life and...

202
00:06:54,188 --> 00:06:55,554
我的老天
Oh, good god.

203
00:06:56,929 --> 00:06:57,907
卡梅隆·塔克
Cameron Tucker.

204
00:06:57,907 --> 00:06:58,926
-盖斯 -你好 盖斯
- Gus. - Hi, Gus.

205
00:06:58,926 --> 00:07:00,158
有什么事 小卡
What do you want, Cam?

206
00:07:00,158 --> 00:07:00,810
有什么事
What do you want?

207
00:07:00,810 --> 00:07:02,593
什么 对了
What? Oh, yes.

208
00:07:02,970 --> 00:07:04,203
你不会想上那架飞机的
You're not gonna want to get in that plane.

209
00:07:04,203 --> 00:07:05,772
歌洛莉亚做了一个很可怕的梦
Gloria had a terrible dream

210
00:07:05,772 --> 00:07:08,430
梦见你从高空坠落然后摔死了
where you fell from a great height and died.

211
00:07:08,430 --> 00:07:10,183
好了 盖斯 我们赶紧远走高飞
All right, Gus. Up, up, and away.

212
00:07:10,183 --> 00:07:11,568
不 杰 她看上去很担忧
No, Jay, she seemed pretty upset,

213
00:07:11,568 --> 00:07:12,658
而且如果梦境不幸成真了
And if something were to happen --

214
00:07:12,658 --> 00:07:14,380
她老是梦见我死了
She's always dreaming about me dying.

215
00:07:14,380 --> 00:07:15,531
迪迪以前也是一样一样的
Dede did the same thing.

216
00:07:15,531 --> 00:07:16,906
这是妻子的典型通性
It's typical wife stuff.

217
00:07:16,906 --> 00:07:18,720
-是吗 -不会有事的 小卡
- Is it? - Nothing's gonna happen, Cam.

218
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,431
-盖斯告诉他 -很安全的
Tell him, Gus. It's perfectly safe.

219
00:07:20,431 --> 00:07:21,277
我会好好照顾他
He's in good hands.

220
00:07:21,277 --> 00:07:23,559
而且你还特别强壮 我都忍不住瞄
Big hands, too -- I couldn't help but notice.

221
00:07:23,559 --> 00:07:24,628
比起因为严重坠机而死
I'm more worried about

222
00:07:24,628 --> 00:07:27,654
我更担心退休后无聊至死
dying from boredom in retirement than from a fiery crash.

223
00:07:27,654 --> 00:07:29,040
好了 谢谢你的关心
Now, thanks for your concern.

224
00:07:29,050 --> 00:07:30,496
拿好你的女士挎包 走吧
Take your purse and go.

225
00:07:30,710 --> 00:07:32,564
你背的是战术挎包 对吧
That's one of those tactical totes, isn't it?

226
00:07:32,575 --> 00:07:33,726
是的
Why, yes.

227
00:07:33,736 --> 00:07:34,653
是的呢 盖斯
Yes, it is, Gus.

228
00:07:34,653 --> 00:07:36,059
得了 走吧 小卡
Anyway, bye, Cam.

229
00:07:36,059 --> 00:07:37,862
不 我哪都不去
No, you know what? I'm not going anywhere,

230
00:07:37,862 --> 00:07:39,645
因为在歌洛莉亚的梦里 我是活着的
Because in Gloria's dream, I was alive.

231
00:07:39,645 --> 00:07:41,927
所以如果我跟着你 这飞机就不会坠毁
So if I'm with you, this plane can't go down.

232
00:07:41,927 --> 00:07:43,923
你觉得你上了这架小飞机
You think you being on this small plane

233
00:07:43,923 --> 00:07:45,788
还能减小它坠毁的可能性吗
makes it less likely to crash?

234
00:07:45,788 --> 00:07:48,661
别当着盖斯的面这样说我
Please don't do this to me in front of Gus, okay?

235
00:07:50,810 --> 00:07:52,247
老天 我还真的是很喜欢怪物
God, I was really into trolls.

236
00:07:52,247 --> 00:07:55,119
没错 尤其是你初中的舞伴 乳牙弟
Yeah, especially your junior prom date with the baby teeth.

237
00:07:55,619 --> 00:07:56,220
你想干嘛
What do you want?

238
00:07:56,220 --> 00:07:57,554
我得找点东西应付克拉特沃斯太太
I need to give Clutterworth something

239
00:07:57,554 --> 00:07:58,960
让她别再烦我
to get her off my back.

240
00:07:59,225 --> 00:07:59,979
我从没想过我会这么说
I never thought I'd say this,

241
00:07:59,979 --> 00:08:01,660
但是我能问你借几件衣服吗
but can I borrow some of your clothes?

242
00:08:01,660 --> 00:08:02,373
这件可以吗
What about this?

243
00:08:02,373 --> 00:08:03,626
不行 不行 把它放下
Oh, no, no, no. Put that down.

244
00:08:03,626 --> 00:08:05,429
-那是桑杰的衣服 -你还要留着它吗
- It's Sanjay's. - And you're gonna keep it?

245
00:08:05,735 --> 00:08:06,927
我还没想好怎么处置它
I don't know what I'm gonna do with it yet.

246
00:08:06,927 --> 00:08:07,752
给你这个
Here.

247
00:08:08,098 --> 00:08:09,952
把它碎个稀烂
Cut it into a million pieces.

248
00:08:10,767 --> 00:08:12,193
他是我第一个真正的男朋友
He was my first real boyfriend.

249
00:08:12,204 --> 00:08:14,445
那又怎样 他劈腿了
So what? He cheated on you.

250
00:08:14,445 --> 00:08:16,768
你得忘了他 翻篇儿过好自己的生活
You need to get over this guy and move on with your life.

251
00:08:16,768 --> 00:08:18,938
我把他忘得一干二净了
I am so over him.

252
00:08:19,518 --> 00:08:20,700
那你还闻什么闻
So why are you sniffing that?

253
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:22,238
我只是闻闻看他的傻气有多重
I'm just smelling how stupid he smells.

254
00:08:22,238 --> 00:08:23,950
我的天
Oh, my god.

255
00:08:24,612 --> 00:08:26,140
好吧 你说得对
Okay, fine. You're right.

256
00:08:26,140 --> 00:08:27,424
我是得翻篇儿了
I need closure.

257
00:08:28,055 --> 00:08:29,777
我在朋友圈上看到他周末回家了
I saw on Instagram he's home for the weekend.

258
00:08:29,777 --> 00:08:30,623
所以呢
So...

259
00:08:30,623 --> 00:08:34,168
你该拿上他的白痴连帽衫和笨鞋
You take his stupid hoodie and his clunky shoes

260
00:08:34,168 --> 00:08:34,759
到他家去
and you go over there

261
00:08:34,759 --> 00:08:36,755
然后把它们扔到他那张二货脸上
and throw them in his dumb face.

262
00:08:36,755 --> 00:08:38,059
鞋子是我的
Those are my shoes.

263
00:08:41,492 --> 00:08:45,802
妈妈 听声音浣熊好像又在打架了
Mommy, it sounds like those raccoons are fighting again.

264
00:08:45,873 --> 00:08:47,014
好吧 我不吹了
Fine, I'll stop.

265
00:08:47,014 --> 00:08:49,765
他懂什么艺术啊
Hey, what does he know about art?

266
00:08:49,775 --> 00:08:50,916
你也看过他画的画
You've seen his drawings.

267
00:08:50,916 --> 00:08:53,025
他觉得杰比一朵花还矮呢
He thinks jay is shorter than a flower.

268
00:08:54,084 --> 00:08:55,276
我不懂到底怎么回事
I don't know what is happening.

269
00:08:55,276 --> 00:08:56,723
我一直努力地在教她
I keep coaching her and coaching her,

270
00:08:56,723 --> 00:08:57,823
可是她却吹得越来越糟了
and she's just getting worse.

271
00:08:57,823 --> 00:08:59,453
我可以给她指点一二
You know what? I'll give her a few tips.

272
00:08:59,453 --> 00:09:01,246
我喜欢用的管类乐器是排箫
My flute of choice has always been the Pan,

273
00:09:01,246 --> 00:09:03,232
不过长笛应该也差不多
but I suppose I could dumb it down.

274
00:09:04,047 --> 00:09:05,087
这简直是个噩梦
This is a nightmare.

275
00:09:05,087 --> 00:09:06,951
是的 她吹得很糟糕
Yes. She's terrible.

276
00:09:06,951 --> 00:09:07,735
不过真正的噩梦
But the nightmare

277
00:09:07,735 --> 00:09:10,302
是梦到你老公坠亡
is seeing your husband plunging to his death

278
00:09:10,302 --> 00:09:12,615
而人们觉得是你
and having people think that you did it

279
00:09:12,615 --> 00:09:14,408
为了巨额保险金下的黑手
for the life insurance payout.

280
00:09:14,408 --> 00:09:15,783
这倒是新鲜
That's a new detail.

281
00:09:16,109 --> 00:09:17,892
歌洛莉亚 梦是预测不了未来的
Gloria, dreams don't predict the future.

282
00:09:17,892 --> 00:09:20,205
那只是你脑中潜意识的反射
They're windows into the subconscious.

283
00:09:20,205 --> 00:09:21,947
也许我爸从高处摔下来
Maybe falling from a great height

284
00:09:21,947 --> 00:09:23,322
指的是他退休的事
is about my dad retiring.

285
00:09:23,322 --> 00:09:24,769
-你真这么想 -对啊 说不定是
- You think? -Yeah, it could be.

286
00:09:24,769 --> 00:09:26,928
他不再是衣柜界的巨头了
He's no longer a big shot in the closet industry,

287
00:09:26,928 --> 00:09:28,986
这肯定也是件大事
which is apparently a thing.

288
00:09:28,986 --> 00:09:31,329
或许你担心你们俩之间会产生隔阂
Maybe you're afraid that the two of you are growing apart.

289
00:09:31,513 --> 00:09:32,878
现在就有隔阂了
It's happening already.

290
00:09:32,878 --> 00:09:35,302
今天我们明明可以一起去做各种有趣的事
Today we could have done all sorts of fun things together,

291
00:09:35,313 --> 00:09:36,943
他却非得去打高尔夫球
and he decided to go golfing!

292
00:09:36,943 --> 00:09:40,294
我们可以去上上舞蹈课 逛逛植物园
We could have gone to dance classes, the arboretum,

293
00:09:40,294 --> 00:09:41,507
或者去参观美术馆啊
the art gallery!

294
00:09:41,507 --> 00:09:43,106
你说的这些更不现实
You're kind of swimming upstream with those.

295
00:09:43,106 --> 00:09:45,408
你要是想让他一起做你喜欢做的事
Look. If -- if you want him to do the things that you love,

296
00:09:45,408 --> 00:09:47,558
你可能要先学点他喜欢做的事
You may have to learn to do the things that he loves.

297
00:09:47,558 --> 00:09:48,821
比如呢
Like what?

298
00:09:49,942 --> 00:09:50,634
打高尔夫吗
Golf?

299
00:09:50,634 --> 00:09:52,601
对 不然嫁给小卡吧
Yeah. Or marry Cam.

300
00:09:52,601 --> 00:09:54,709
你想参加的那一切活动他都喜欢
He loves all that gay stuff you want to do.

301
00:09:55,657 --> 00:09:57,032
克莱尔 等等 等等
Claire, wait, wait, wait, wait!

302
00:09:57,032 --> 00:09:57,980
亲爱的
Honey.

303
00:09:58,448 --> 00:10:00,170
我们还有一箱东西要捐的
We got another box of stuff to give away.

304
00:10:00,170 --> 00:10:01,769
-真的吗 -对啊 把后车箱打开吧
- Really? - Yep! Pop her open.

305
00:10:01,769 --> 00:10:02,574
好嘞
Okay.

306
00:10:02,584 --> 00:10:04,836
话说关于阿吸你说得太对了
You were so right about the Flowbee, by the way.

307
00:10:04,836 --> 00:10:07,678
它是很好 但有了它我会错过理发店的八卦
It is great, but I would miss all the gossip at the salon.

308
00:10:07,678 --> 00:10:08,391
我迫不及待地想知道
I'm dying to hear

309
00:10:08,391 --> 00:10:11,050
娜塔莎的雌激素贴片有没有起作用
if Natasha's estrogen patch is making a difference.

310
00:10:11,050 --> 00:10:13,057
我周三见到她了 没什么变化
I saw her Wednesday. It's not.

311
00:10:13,067 --> 00:10:14,707
你后面弄好了吗
Hey, you almost done back there?

312
00:10:14,707 --> 00:10:15,665
我在腾点空出来
Just making some room!

313
00:10:15,665 --> 00:10:16,439
你知道吗
You know what?

314
00:10:16,439 --> 00:10:18,232
我很高兴能为你做这些
I am so happy to do this for you.

315
00:10:18,232 --> 00:10:20,015
我爱你远远胜于爱我那台酿酒机
I love you way more than my beer making kit...

316
00:10:20,025 --> 00:10:20,993
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

317
00:10:20,993 --> 00:10:22,613
那个木制网球拍
the wooden tennis racket.

318
00:10:22,613 --> 00:10:24,783
还有什么呢 那个牛仔帽
I don't know, the cowboy hat.

319
00:10:24,783 --> 00:10:25,964
棕色那个
The brown one.

320
00:10:26,117 --> 00:10:27,717
怎么还没完啊
What is taking so long?

321
00:10:28,491 --> 00:10:29,764
-搞定了 -好
- All set! - Okay.

322
00:10:29,775 --> 00:10:30,681
待会儿见
I'll see you guys later,

323
00:10:30,681 --> 00:10:32,321
感谢你们今天帮忙收拾
and thank you so much for helping out today.

324
00:10:32,321 --> 00:10:34,868
随时为您服务 克拉特沃斯夫人 亲亲双颊
At your service, Lady Clutterworth. Kiss on both cheeks.

325
00:10:34,868 --> 00:10:35,887
一切如意
Bob's your uncle.

326
00:10:36,488 --> 00:10:37,405
快把手举高 挥手
Keep waving up high.

327
00:10:37,486 --> 00:10:39,178
举起来挥手 这样她就注意不到下面的东西了
Wave up high so she can't look down low.

328
00:10:41,867 --> 00:10:43,497
-我靠... -你们开玩笑吧
- Son of a... - Seriously?

329
00:10:43,497 --> 00:10:45,443
亲爱的 我们不想把这些东西捐掉
Honey, we don't want to give this stuff away.

330
00:10:45,443 --> 00:10:46,146
我们很喜欢它们
We like it.

331
00:10:46,146 --> 00:10:47,144
这些东西对我们很重要
It's important to us.

332
00:10:47,154 --> 00:10:48,774
这些东西怎么可能对你重要了
How can it be important to you?

333
00:10:48,774 --> 00:10:50,160
要不是我让你们翻箱倒柜找出来
You didn't even know it existed

334
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,584
你们甚至都不知道它们还在
Until I told you to go through the closet and find it.

335
00:10:52,584 --> 00:10:54,347
这不是重点
That is beside the point!

336
00:10:54,347 --> 00:10:56,608
所有这些东西都充满了意义
All of this stuff is packed with meaning!

337
00:10:56,608 --> 00:10:57,352
真的吗 菲尔
Really, Phil?

338
00:10:57,352 --> 00:10:59,532
这个廉价的雪花玻璃球对你有什么意义
What does this cheap snow globe mean to you?

339
00:10:59,532 --> 00:11:00,948
那是我们在弗罗里达州的一个加油站买的
We got that at a gas station in Florida.

340
00:11:00,958 --> 00:11:02,018
雪人已经融化了
The snowman's melted.

341
00:11:02,018 --> 00:11:02,904
这个以前只是好玩而已
It used to just be funny,

342
00:11:02,904 --> 00:11:04,982
但现在它也成了对全球变暖现象的讥讽
but now it's also a poignant statement on global warming.

343
00:11:04,982 --> 00:11:06,510
是对囤物癖的讥讽还差不多
It's a poignant statement on hoarding,

344
00:11:06,510 --> 00:11:07,437
我们要把它
and we are donating it

345
00:11:07,448 --> 00:11:09,679
连同其他这些垃圾一起捐了
along with the rest of this junk.

346
00:11:09,852 --> 00:11:11,961
真没想到你们俩还来这招
Well, I can't believe you two.

347
00:11:12,236 --> 00:11:13,896
等我回去上班后 你们就知道感激我了
You'll thank me when I'm back at work

348
00:11:13,906 --> 00:11:14,833
那时候我也没时间
and I don't have time

349
00:11:14,833 --> 00:11:17,635
每时每刻跟在你们后面收拾烂摊子了
to be picking up after you every two minutes.

350
00:11:18,450 --> 00:11:19,285
你猜怎么着
Guess what?

351
00:11:20,090 --> 00:11:21,853
她没拿走我的幸运帽
She didn't get my lucky hat.

352
00:11:23,768 --> 00:11:25,296
你还不如留下球拍呢
You should have kept the racket.

353
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:28,281
一起全身心投入 好吗
Let's just dive in, all right?

354
00:11:28,291 --> 00:11:29,544
-我准备好了 -很好
- I'm ready! - Good.

355
00:11:29,544 --> 00:11:31,205
- 好的 来一杆吧 -好
- All right, take a swing. - Okay.

356
00:11:31,205 --> 00:11:31,938
看看你目前是个什么水平
Let's see what we're dealing with.

357
00:11:31,938 --> 00:11:33,639
-我走到这前面... -对 是这样
- I get in front here... - Yes, you do.

358
00:11:33,639 --> 00:11:34,658
然后
And then...

359
00:11:34,882 --> 00:11:38,193
一 二 三
One, two, three!

360
00:11:40,842 --> 00:11:42,217
球飞得好远啊
It went so far away.

361
00:11:42,411 --> 00:11:43,654
我真是个天才
I am a natural.

362
00:11:43,654 --> 00:11:45,762
不 他才是 你的球还在球座上没动呢
No, he is. Your ball is still on the tee.

363
00:11:46,476 --> 00:11:47,545
那我比我想的还糟糕呢
I am worse than I thought then.

364
00:11:47,545 --> 00:11:48,900
不 不 不 不 没事的
No, no, no, no, no. It's fine.

365
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:51,060
你只要记住一些简单的基本要领
You just need to remember a few of the simple fundamentals

366
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:53,709
我以前学的时候也很受用的
that helped me when I was learning, okay?

367
00:11:53,709 --> 00:11:54,493
别担心 别担心
Don't worry about it. Don't worry about it.

368
00:11:54,493 --> 00:11:56,031
先在球前面站好位置
Just line yourself up in front of the ball.

369
00:11:56,031 --> 00:11:56,958
接下来你要做的就是
Now what you want to do is keep

370
00:11:56,969 --> 00:11:58,517
把你的右手大拇指放在球杆的左侧
your right thumb on the left side of the shaft.

371
00:11:58,517 --> 00:11:59,678
-这个拇指 -对的
- This one? - Yeah, mm-hmm.

372
00:11:59,678 --> 00:12:01,655
然后低下头 好的
And then keep your head down. Okay.

373
00:12:01,655 --> 00:12:03,550
-接下来左臂伸直 -好的
- Okay, and then the left arm straight... - Okay.

374
00:12:03,550 --> 00:12:04,273
左手腕托起
Cup that left wrist.

375
00:12:04,273 --> 00:12:05,832
我有次把脚这样放 而且
There was one time when I put the leg and --

376
00:12:05,832 --> 00:12:06,830
那样没啥用
That was not helpful.

377
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,684
但是我觉得我想这样 不行吗
But then I feel like I want -- no?

378
00:12:08,684 --> 00:12:09,754
不行 别那样做
Mm, I don't want you to do that.

379
00:12:09,754 --> 00:12:10,355
-好吧 -今天不行
- Okay. - Not today.

380
00:12:10,365 --> 00:12:11,180
再下来你要做的是
And then what you're gonna do

381
00:12:11,180 --> 00:12:12,902
当你向上挥杆时 右手肘要保持在身体前方
is keep the right elbow in front of the body

382
00:12:12,902 --> 00:12:15,082
然后转动臀部
as you swing up, and then rotate those hips.

383
00:12:15,082 --> 00:12:17,262
一 二 三
One, two, three!

384
00:12:19,554 --> 00:12:20,868
我的妈呀
Ay! Mama!

385
00:12:21,653 --> 00:12:24,128
这球还能再打一次 回本儿了
Well, we're getting our money's worth out of that ball.

386
00:12:31,361 --> 00:12:32,798
复活节快乐
Happy Easter!

387
00:12:34,418 --> 00:12:35,885
复活节快乐
Happy Easter!

388
00:12:36,557 --> 00:12:37,311
阿鸡
Chickie?

389
00:12:37,311 --> 00:12:38,645
我听到那声音的那一刻
The minute I heard that voice,

390
00:12:38,645 --> 00:12:41,009
所有回忆都如潮水般涌入脑海
all the memories came flooding back --

391
00:12:41,009 --> 00:12:42,985
大家在后院一起藏鸡蛋
Hiding eggs in the backyard,

392
00:12:42,985 --> 00:12:44,615
小女孩们穿着小裙子
the girls in their dresses,

393
00:12:44,615 --> 00:12:46,479
卢克穿着他的小西装
Luke in his little blazer,

394
00:12:46,479 --> 00:12:49,301
菲尔则穿着 萌兔装
Phil in his...bunny suit.

395
00:12:49,617 --> 00:12:50,911
复活节快乐
Happy Easter!

396
00:12:50,911 --> 00:12:52,633
等下 坚持住 阿鸡
Hang on! Hang on, Chickie!

397
00:12:52,633 --> 00:12:54,039
-妈妈来救你了 -复活节快乐
- Mama's coming. - Happy Easter!

398
00:12:54,039 --> 00:12:55,791
等等 我来了
Hang on. I'm coming.

399
00:12:55,801 --> 00:12:57,940
宝贝 我没打算把你扔掉
Baby, I didn't mean to throw you away.

400
00:12:57,940 --> 00:12:59,214
-复活节快乐 -等等
- Happy Easter! - Hang on.

401
00:12:59,499 --> 00:13:00,721
我听到了啦
I can hear you.

402
00:13:00,732 --> 00:13:02,606
我不讨厌这件背心
I-I -- oh, I don't hate this blouse.

403
00:13:02,606 --> 00:13:03,900
复活节快乐
Happy Easter!

404
00:13:04,450 --> 00:13:05,805
感觉太奇怪了
This feels very weird.

405
00:13:05,815 --> 00:13:06,701
但是看起来很好
Well, it looks great.

406
00:13:06,701 --> 00:13:08,953
右手臂弯曲
Now hinge your right arm into an L-shape,

407
00:13:08,953 --> 00:13:10,481
双手放低
Keep your hands low,

408
00:13:10,481 --> 00:13:12,518
把重心转移到前脚
Shift all the weight into the front foot...

409
00:13:14,699 --> 00:13:15,931
接下来要怎么做
What do I do next?

410
00:13:15,972 --> 00:13:17,419
开除你的高尔夫教练
Fire your golf coach!

411
00:13:18,183 --> 00:13:19,252
无意冒犯 红发
No offense, Red.

412
00:13:19,252 --> 00:13:20,475
没关系 光头
None taken, Bald.

413
00:13:20,954 --> 00:13:21,809
看
Here.

414
00:13:22,329 --> 00:13:23,175
跟着我做
Just do what I do.

415
00:13:23,185 --> 00:13:24,224
什么 变光头吗
What, lose all your hair?

416
00:13:24,886 --> 00:13:26,699
抱歉 我想我有点过了
I'm sorry. I guess I was a little offended.

417
00:13:27,596 --> 00:13:28,564
你喜欢跳舞吗
Do you like dancing?

418
00:13:28,564 --> 00:13:30,581
喜欢啊 我跳舞
Yes, and I am much better

419
00:13:30,581 --> 00:13:32,099
比这个厉害多了
doing that than doing this.

420
00:13:32,099 --> 00:13:34,452
这就跟跳舞一样
Well, this is just like dancing.

421
00:13:34,584 --> 00:13:36,123
把他说的全部忘掉
Forget everything he said.

422
00:13:36,316 --> 00:13:38,425
只要把握节奏就行 跟我学
It's all about the rhythm. Follow me.

423
00:13:38,425 --> 00:13:40,952
摆回去 挥出去
Swing back. Follow through.

424
00:13:41,288 --> 00:13:42,388
摆回去
Swing back.

425
00:13:42,704 --> 00:13:43,610
挥出去
Follow through.

426
00:13:43,865 --> 00:13:45,200
摆回去
Swing back.

427
00:13:47,736 --> 00:13:49,010
我做到了
I did it!

428
00:13:50,416 --> 00:13:51,923
你被开除了 红发
You're fired, red.

429
00:13:54,124 --> 00:13:55,183
平飞
Level her off.

430
00:13:57,251 --> 00:13:58,107
很好
Good job.

431
00:13:58,372 --> 00:13:59,798
听到了吗 完美
You hear that? Flawless.

432
00:14:00,460 --> 00:14:02,355
说是我的第二天性也不为过
It makes sense this is second nature.

433
00:14:02,467 --> 00:14:04,627
我已经上过很多远程操控的课程
I've logged a lot of remote-control hours.

434
00:14:04,627 --> 00:14:07,001
盖斯 你说无线电遥控和真实操作
Gus, what would you say is harder,

435
00:14:07,001 --> 00:14:08,437
哪个比较难
R/c or the real thing?

436
00:14:08,437 --> 00:14:09,324
真实操作
The real thing.

437
00:14:09,772 --> 00:14:10,801
很难决定啊
Tough call.

438
00:14:12,553 --> 00:14:14,010
后面什么东西在响
What's rattling back there?

439
00:14:14,112 --> 00:14:14,906
我不...
Uh, well, I don't --

440
00:14:14,906 --> 00:14:16,546
我不知道这是什么玩意儿
I don't know what this thing is.

441
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:18,380
-我来处理 -收到
- My controls. - Roger that.

442
00:14:18,737 --> 00:14:19,980
拖杆松了吗
That tow bar come loose?

443
00:14:19,980 --> 00:14:21,059
不知道
Well, I don't know.

444
00:14:21,059 --> 00:14:22,160
这
Is...

445
00:14:22,455 --> 00:14:24,768
-这是拖杆吗 -是的 没错
- Is this -- is this the tow bar? - Yeah, that's it.

446
00:14:25,175 --> 00:14:26,805
-抱歉 我的错 抱歉 -不不不
- Oh, ooh! Sorry, my bad. Sorry, sorry. - No, no,

447
00:14:26,805 --> 00:14:28,741
没关系 我拿到了 我拿到了
That's all right. I got it. I got it.

448
00:14:29,444 --> 00:14:32,021
花生糖 今天真是太幸运了
Peanut brittle, could this day get any better?

449
00:14:33,539 --> 00:14:34,914
把拖杆从支架上拿开
Get the tow bar off the yoke!

450
00:14:34,914 --> 00:14:36,463
不行 卡在座位中间了
No, it's stuck between the seat!

451
00:14:36,463 --> 00:14:38,337
不行 算了吧 我来
I can't! Let it go! I got it!

452
00:14:39,519 --> 00:14:40,568
盖斯 盖斯
Oh, Gus! Gus!

453
00:14:41,078 --> 00:14:42,575
我最讨厌歌洛莉亚又说中了
I hate it when Gloria's right.

454
00:14:46,019 --> 00:14:48,973
盖斯 快醒醒 盖斯 天哪 他的颧骨
Gus. Stay with us, Gus. Oh, my god. Those cheekbones.

455
00:14:48,973 --> 00:14:50,420
简直跟小肯尼迪一样帅
You look like J.F.K. Jr.

456
00:14:50,807 --> 00:14:52,447
他长得像小肯尼迪[死于空难]
He looks like J.F.K. Jr.!

457
00:14:52,447 --> 00:14:53,557
我不知道我在干什么
I don't know what I'm doing.

458
00:14:53,557 --> 00:14:54,566
开自动驾驶
Well, put it on autopilot.

459
00:14:54,566 --> 00:14:56,308
-开自动驾驶 -没有自动驾驶
- Put it on autopilot! - There is no autopilot.

460
00:14:56,308 --> 00:14:57,459
这就是个带翅膀的割草机而已
This is a lawnmower with wings.

461
00:14:57,459 --> 00:14:58,987
你开过遥控飞机啊
You fly remote control planes!

462
00:14:58,987 --> 00:15:00,841
-就按你以前那样开啊 -我把它们都撞坏了
- Do what you do there! - I crash them!

463
00:15:00,841 --> 00:15:02,339
所以我才不断买新的
That's why I buy them all the time!

464
00:15:03,154 --> 00:15:03,663
我错了
I was wrong.

465
00:15:03,663 --> 00:15:04,753
我不想这样死掉啊
I don't want to die this way.

466
00:15:04,753 --> 00:15:07,361
我宁愿平静无聊地在地上死去
I'll settle for a nice, boring death at ground level.

467
00:15:07,361 --> 00:15:10,153
严格说来 我们还是会死在地上的
Well, technically, we will be dying at ground level!

468
00:15:11,345 --> 00:15:13,239
我来 我来 我来
I got it! I got it! I got it!

469
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:17,345
好了
Okay.

470
00:15:18,659 --> 00:15:20,258
-我们没事了 -太好了
- We're good. - Great.

471
00:15:20,269 --> 00:15:20,900
就跟你说下
Just so you know

472
00:15:20,900 --> 00:15:23,957
我一直都非常镇定
I completely kept my cool through that whole thing.

473
00:15:26,717 --> 00:15:29,386
听我说 我知道打中几杆运气球确实感觉很好
Listen, I know it felt great to hit a couple of lucky shots.

474
00:15:29,386 --> 00:15:31,536
我打了一整桶运气球呢
I hit a whole bucket of lucky shots.

475
00:15:31,536 --> 00:15:33,023
但是没有学好技术
But there's a limit to how good you can get

476
00:15:33,023 --> 00:15:34,653
想要进步多少就很有限
without learning the proper techniques.

477
00:15:34,663 --> 00:15:36,181
我在教你...
I was trying to show you, but --

478
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:40,185
-非常好 莉莉 -你做了什么
- Very good, Lily. - What did you do?

479
00:15:40,185 --> 00:15:42,905
我只告诉她忘掉一切 用心感受音乐
I just told her to forget everything and feel the music.

480
00:15:42,905 --> 00:15:45,584
二爸 以后就由曼尼来教我了
Dad, Manny's gonna teach me from now on.

481
00:15:45,849 --> 00:15:48,610
这是你今天第二次被开了 红发
Ay, this is the second time you got fired today, Red.

482
00:15:49,038 --> 00:15:50,953
一 二 三
One, two, three.

483
00:15:50,953 --> 00:15:52,930
听着 每个人学习的方式不一样
Look, everybody learns in different ways.

484
00:15:52,930 --> 00:15:56,067
我这种高智商的方法不适合歌洛莉亚
My intellectual approach just wasn't right for Gloria,

485
00:15:56,067 --> 00:15:58,492
可能也不适合莉莉
and it probably wasn't right for Lily.

486
00:15:59,042 --> 00:16:00,570
这么说确实很惭愧
It -- it's humbling to admit,

487
00:16:00,580 --> 00:16:03,596
但我就是太聪明了 不适合教人
but I'm just too smart to teach.

488
00:16:04,339 --> 00:16:06,163
坚强点 我为你自豪
Be strong. I'm proud of you.

489
00:16:06,448 --> 00:16:07,569
谢谢
Thanks.

490
00:16:10,228 --> 00:16:13,009
很多姑娘会打扮得性感
You know, a lot of girls would have tried to look sexy

491
00:16:13,009 --> 00:16:14,588
让他看看他错过了什么
to show him what he's missing.

492
00:16:14,832 --> 00:16:16,065
所以呢
Is there more to that?

493
00:16:16,065 --> 00:16:18,673
没有 只是想理解你的想法
No, just trying to figure you out.

494
00:16:22,402 --> 00:16:23,706
你好 桑杰
Hello, Sanjay.

495
00:16:23,818 --> 00:16:25,967
还是应该叫你'桑感情'呢
Or should we call you "Sans-feelings"?

496
00:16:26,181 --> 00:16:27,343
重新来
Start over.

497
00:16:28,799 --> 00:16:30,114
你把这个落在我家了
You left this at my house.

498
00:16:30,124 --> 00:16:32,477
我本来打算把它剪得稀巴烂的
I was going to just cut it up in tiny little pieces,

499
00:16:32,477 --> 00:16:33,160
但我觉得应该让你直视
but I thought you should have to

500
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,686
被你伤害了的人的眼睛
look into the eyes of the person you hurt.

501
00:16:36,134 --> 00:16:37,927
我希望你的新女友值得让你这样做
I hope your new little girlfriend is worth it.

502
00:16:37,927 --> 00:16:39,832
她不值得 那是个天大的错误
She wasn't. It was a huge mistake.

503
00:16:40,026 --> 00:16:41,697
我不习惯女孩子喜欢我
I'm not used to girls liking me.

504
00:16:42,053 --> 00:16:43,622
斯坦福的女孩子个个都很出众
Stanford girls are all type "A".

505
00:16:43,622 --> 00:16:45,313
她们都非常咄咄逼人
They're very aggressive.

506
00:16:45,772 --> 00:16:47,096
我完全傻了
I'm in way over my head.

507
00:16:47,096 --> 00:16:48,930
这样咱俩就没事了吗
And that's supposed to make this okay?

508
00:16:48,930 --> 00:16:50,876
不 有事
No. Nothing's okay.

509
00:16:50,886 --> 00:16:51,894
我很痛苦
I'm miserable.

510
00:16:52,393 --> 00:16:53,810
我每天都很想你
And I miss you every day.

511
00:16:53,810 --> 00:16:54,788
说得好听
Yeah, right.

512
00:16:55,134 --> 00:16:57,834
-你至于吗 -他好像很真诚啊
- Seriously? - Oh, well, he seems sincere.

513
00:16:57,834 --> 00:16:58,862
没错
I am.

514
00:16:59,555 --> 00:17:00,941
虽然物理定律不会允许
If I could go back in time,

515
00:17:01,206 --> 00:17:03,070
但是如果能回到过去
which the laws of physics don't disallow,

516
00:17:04,109 --> 00:17:05,342
我不会再伤害你了
I never would have hurt you.

517
00:17:05,342 --> 00:17:07,848
如果你相信多元宇宙的话
Well, if you believe in the multi-verse,

518
00:17:07,848 --> 00:17:10,537
就会有一个时空气泡 在那里
there currently exists a bubble of space-time

519
00:17:10,537 --> 00:17:11,780
你没有伤害我
where you didn't.

520
00:17:12,259 --> 00:17:13,318
我希望我们在那里
I wish we were there.

521
00:17:13,318 --> 00:17:13,960
天哪
Oh, my God.

522
00:17:13,970 --> 00:17:15,030
这就是学霸的前戏吗
Is this geek foreplay?

523
00:17:15,030 --> 00:17:16,833
因为我完全听不懂
'cause I don't understand any of this.

524
00:17:16,833 --> 00:17:19,319
如果你真的那么不开心 你为什么没有联系我
If you were so unhappy, why didn't you contact me?

525
00:17:19,319 --> 00:17:21,081
我很羞耻 很尴尬
I was ashamed and embarrassed.

526
00:17:21,102 --> 00:17:23,557
我已经打算一个人度过余生了
I came to terms with being alone for the rest of my life.

527
00:17:23,577 --> 00:17:24,922
我回家过周末
I'm home for the weekend,

528
00:17:24,922 --> 00:17:26,562
但我父母都不在这里
and my parents aren't even here.

529
00:17:26,654 --> 00:17:29,292
-你父母不在家吗 -这话我懂
- You're parents aren't home? - That, I understand.

530
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:32,644
我回来了
I'm home!

531
00:17:32,644 --> 00:17:33,551
爸爸
Hi, Daddy.

532
00:17:33,551 --> 00:17:34,498
你们在这啊
There they are.

533
00:17:34,641 --> 00:17:35,955
我的家人
There's my family.

534
00:17:35,955 --> 00:17:37,789
爸爸抱抱 小猴子
Come here, you little monkey!

535
00:17:37,799 --> 00:17:39,999
不 你又输了多少钱
Ay, no. How much money did you lose?

536
00:17:39,999 --> 00:17:41,517
我今天没打高尔夫
I didn't play golf today.

537
00:17:41,701 --> 00:17:43,218
我学开飞机去了
I took a flying lesson.

538
00:17:43,595 --> 00:17:44,971
感觉如何
Hmm? And how was that?

539
00:17:45,154 --> 00:17:46,224
没什么特别的
Uneventful.

540
00:17:46,224 --> 00:17:47,742
那你怎么之前没说
Why didn't you tell me about it?

541
00:17:47,742 --> 00:17:49,453
我想给你个惊喜
I wanted it to be a surprise.

542
00:17:49,453 --> 00:17:52,621
那我也要给你一个惊喜
Oh, well, then I have a surprise for you, too.

543
00:17:52,621 --> 00:17:54,771
我去学打高尔夫了
I took a golf lesson.

544
00:17:54,771 --> 00:17:56,187
开玩笑吧 为什么
You're kidding. Why?

545
00:17:56,228 --> 00:17:57,379
我想跟你一起打啊
To play with you.

546
00:17:57,379 --> 00:17:58,673
想都别想
That's not gonna happen.

547
00:17:58,673 --> 00:18:00,568
达琳开始和小短一起打球了
Darlene started playing with Shorty.

548
00:18:00,568 --> 00:18:01,841
她嘴巴说个不停
She never stops talking.

549
00:18:01,841 --> 00:18:05,030
小短得故意打个曲球 好在捡球时有点清净
He had to develop a slice just to get some alone time.

550
00:18:05,030 --> 00:18:06,018
那你想怎么办
So what do you want to do?

551
00:18:06,018 --> 00:18:07,913
一个人开着你那小飞机吗
Fly alone in your little plane?

552
00:18:07,913 --> 00:18:10,755
不 我是想找件咱们能一起做的事情
No. The whole point is to find something we can do together.

553
00:18:10,755 --> 00:18:13,231
比如飞到纳帕[加州酒乡]去吃个午餐
I pictured zipping up to napa for lunch,

554
00:18:13,434 --> 00:18:15,401
到赛多纳[亚利桑那印第安圣地]吃个夕阳晚餐
Sedona for a sunset dinner.

555
00:18:15,401 --> 00:18:16,969
你一吃完饭就睡着了
You fall asleep after every meal.

556
00:18:16,980 --> 00:18:18,956
我才不要和你一起坐飞机
I am not getting on a plane with you.

557
00:18:18,956 --> 00:18:19,975
怎么会呢
That's not true.

558
00:18:19,975 --> 00:18:21,594
你吃了个烤芝士三明治
You eat a grilled cheese sandwich

559
00:18:21,594 --> 00:18:23,459
想走到沙发上都费劲
and you can barely make it to the couch.

560
00:18:23,459 --> 00:18:24,895
甜美的烤芝士催人眠
Nothing like a grilled cheese nap.

561
00:18:24,895 --> 00:18:27,289
我也不想要你到处开飞机
I don't want you flying around in a little plane, either.

562
00:18:27,289 --> 00:18:28,889
这大概是我的人生梦想
Well, it's kind of my life's dream,

563
00:18:28,889 --> 00:18:31,935
但如果你不愿意我做 我就不做了
but if you want me to stop, I'll do it for you.

564
00:18:31,935 --> 00:18:33,473
我昨晚做了个噩梦
I had a bad dream last night.

565
00:18:33,473 --> 00:18:37,140
我觉得你退休这事让我有点害怕
I think that this retirement thing is making me very scared.

566
00:18:37,140 --> 00:18:38,231
我又何尝不是[加入俱乐部]
Join the club.

567
00:18:38,281 --> 00:18:39,738
但别加入我的乡村俱乐部
Just not my country club.

568
00:18:41,042 --> 00:18:42,693
一切都会没事的
Everything's gonna be okay.

569
00:18:42,754 --> 00:18:43,823
你怎么知道呢
How do you know that?

570
00:18:43,823 --> 00:18:46,982
我不知道 但我们双方都花了一天时间想做些
I don't. But we both spent the day trying to do something

571
00:18:46,982 --> 00:18:48,652
我们认为能让对方开心的事
we thought would make the other one happy

572
00:18:48,652 --> 00:18:49,773
这就是个不错的开头
and that's a pretty good start.

573
00:18:49,773 --> 00:18:52,147
看来我们只要找到
I guess we just have to find something

574
00:18:52,147 --> 00:18:53,308
双方都感兴趣的事
that we have in common,

575
00:18:53,308 --> 00:18:55,570
可以一起规划的事情
Like a project to do together!

576
00:18:55,570 --> 00:18:58,218
-我还在呢 -等等 妈妈在想事情
- Hello? - In a minute. Mommy's thinking.

577
00:19:00,154 --> 00:19:01,325
克拉特沃斯跑哪儿去了
Where the hell is Clutterworth?

578
00:19:01,325 --> 00:19:03,923
在贫民区把我们的记忆分发给流浪汉
On skid row giving our memories to hobos.

579
00:19:03,923 --> 00:19:05,462
她把我所有旧的时尚杂志都扔了
She threw out all my old Vogues.

580
00:19:05,462 --> 00:19:07,642
没有参考 我会错穿过去流行现在过时的衣服
If I don't know the past, I'm doomed to re-wear it.

581
00:19:07,835 --> 00:19:09,058
老妈 这回
Mom, this time --

582
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:10,464
是你啊
Oh, it's just you.

583
00:19:10,932 --> 00:19:11,951
你们好啊
Hey, party people.

584
00:19:11,961 --> 00:19:13,245
你高兴个什么劲儿
Why are you so happy?

585
00:19:13,245 --> 00:19:15,629
去了趟桑杰家 翻了个篇儿
Went over to Sanjay's, got a little closure.

586
00:19:15,629 --> 00:19:18,237
是吗 你的衣服倒是翻出来了
Yeah? Well, some of your clothes are on inside out.

587
00:19:18,237 --> 00:19:20,610
你终于出现了 你把我的杂志全扔了
There you are. You threw out all my magazines.

588
00:19:20,610 --> 00:19:21,843
要不是我当时在场
Yeah, and if I hadn't been here,

589
00:19:21,843 --> 00:19:23,208
你就把桑杰的套头衫扔了
you would have thrown out Sanjay's hoodie

590
00:19:23,208 --> 00:19:25,042
我也就没机会把衣服还给他
and then I would have never gotten the chance to return it,

591
00:19:25,042 --> 00:19:27,578
他也就没机会向我表达他的未尽之爱
and then he never would have declared his undying love for me.

592
00:19:28,332 --> 00:19:29,820
没错 姐满血复活了
That's right. I'm back.

593
00:19:29,820 --> 00:19:31,388
你把我的幸运棒拿走了
And you took my lucky stick.

594
00:19:31,388 --> 00:19:32,540
我超喜欢那根棒棒
I love that stick.

595
00:19:32,540 --> 00:19:34,547
我找到我最喜欢的石头时拿的就是那根棒棒
I was holding it when I found my favorite rock.

596
00:19:34,669 --> 00:19:35,433
天啊
Oh, my god.

597
00:19:35,433 --> 00:19:37,155
别告诉我你把阿石也扔了
Please tell me you didn't throw out Rocky.

598
00:19:37,155 --> 00:19:38,082
没错
You're right.

599
00:19:38,245 --> 00:19:40,537
你们都没错 我是个糟糕的母亲
You're all right. I'm a terrible mother.

600
00:19:40,578 --> 00:19:41,474
对不起
I'm sorry.

601
00:19:41,474 --> 00:19:42,880
这是怎么回事
What is happening?

602
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,326
已经过了五点[下班时间]了吗
Is it after 5:00 already?

603
00:19:44,326 --> 00:19:46,710
-你回来了 -老爸 有点不对劲
- Hey, you're back. - Dad, something's wrong.

604
00:19:46,710 --> 00:19:48,096
老妈在道歉
Mom's apologizing.

605
00:19:48,452 --> 00:19:49,410
我们看过表了
No, we checked.

606
00:19:49,410 --> 00:19:50,836
我没能救下阿鸡
I couldn't save Chickie.

607
00:19:51,295 --> 00:19:53,597
一想起还有那么多我没能救下来的
And think about all the others I didn't save --

608
00:19:53,903 --> 00:19:57,040
马里布芭比 粉兔枕头
Malibu Barbie, Pink Bunny Pillow,

609
00:19:57,142 --> 00:19:58,344
筋肉人阿姆斯壮
Stretch Armstrong.

610
00:19:58,344 --> 00:20:01,309
慢着 你把我的筋肉人阿姆斯壮扔了
Wait. You threw away my Stretch Armstrong?

611
00:20:01,309 --> 00:20:03,071
是啊 没了 它们都没了
Yes. It's gone. They are all gone.

612
00:20:03,082 --> 00:20:04,966
每年的大扫除根除了
Years of stress cleaning has eradicated

613
00:20:04,966 --> 00:20:06,993
一生的珍贵记忆
a lifetime of precious memories.

614
00:20:07,381 --> 00:20:09,999
如果没有呢
Well, what if it hasn't?

615
00:20:09,999 --> 00:20:12,648
你是在说平行于现实的另一个宇宙吗
Are you suggesting an alternate universe that parallels reality?

616
00:20:12,648 --> 00:20:16,325
我是在说平行于公路的储物车库
I'm suggesting a storage unit that parallels the freeway.

617
00:20:19,585 --> 00:20:20,706
天啊
Oh, my god.

618
00:20:20,736 --> 00:20:22,855
都是我们的旧东西
It's all our old stuff.

619
00:20:23,059 --> 00:20:24,149
我的第一辆自行车
Ah! My first bike!

620
00:20:24,149 --> 00:20:26,421
-我的梵高作业 -我的第一台电话
- My Van Gogh project! - My first phone!

621
00:20:26,533 --> 00:20:28,092
好的 我等丽兹·麦克奎尔接电话
Yes, I'll hold for Lizzie McGuire.

622
00:20:28,092 --> 00:20:30,180
你不是都拿去捐了吗
So all of those trips to the donation bin...

623
00:20:30,180 --> 00:20:31,525
有时候我没有捐成
I didn't always make it.

624
00:20:31,892 --> 00:20:33,878
-你生气了吗 -太好了
- Are you mad? - It's amazing.

625
00:20:34,021 --> 00:20:35,905
看到没 我管住了我的女人
See? I'm controlling my woman.

626
00:20:35,905 --> 00:20:38,085
这件衣服太有范儿了
Oh, this is totally back in style.

627
00:20:38,136 --> 00:20:39,766
天啊 扭扭乐
OH, my god! Twister!

628
00:20:40,347 --> 00:20:41,264
我也找到了[电影《龙卷风》]
Me, too.

629
00:20:41,396 --> 00:20:42,313
我很...
I'm...

630
00:20:45,043 --> 00:20:46,103
没什么...
It's no...

631
00:20:49,394 --> 00:20:51,085
你把身上那股子劲儿
You just take that nutty energy of yours

632
00:20:51,085 --> 00:20:52,633
全都投到工作里去
and put it to good use at the office,

633
00:20:52,633 --> 00:20:54,854
我们在家里等你
and we'll be waiting for you when you get home.

634
00:20:55,068 --> 00:20:57,360
你知道我们报税的时候没有算这些东西了吧
You know we already claimed all this stuff on our taxes, right?

635
00:20:57,360 --> 00:20:59,438
没错
There's my girl. Yeah.

636
00:21:03,401 --> 00:21:05,449
虽然大费周折 但我拿回来了
It wasn't easy, but I got it!

637
00:21:05,836 --> 00:21:06,946
阿鸡
Chickie!

638
00:21:06,977 --> 00:21:07,721
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

639
00:21:07,721 --> 00:21:08,719
有点黏
A little sticky, huh?

640
00:21:08,719 --> 00:21:09,921
复活节快乐
Happy Easter!

641
00:21:11,093 --> 00:21:12,152
它真的就只会说这一句吗
Oh! Is that really all it says?

642
00:21:12,152 --> 00:21:14,017
我记得它还能说别的呢
I feel like it used to say more.

643
00:21:15,147 --> 00:21:17,501
-复活节快乐 -老妈 别捏了
- Happy Easter! - Mom, stop squeezing it.

644
00:21:17,501 --> 00:21:19,823
-我没有 我没捏它 -复活节快乐
- I'm n-- I'm not. I'm not squeezing it. - Happy Easter!

645
00:21:20,618 --> 00:21:21,525
真的好吵啊
It's really annoying.

646
00:21:21,616 --> 00:21:23,053
-我什么都没干 -复活节快乐
- I'm not doing anything. - Happy Easter!

647
00:21:23,053 --> 00:21:24,499
-蕴含了好多回忆 -是啊
- So many good memories, though. - Yep.

648
00:21:24,988 --> 00:21:25,854
复活节快乐
Happy Easter!

649
00:21:25,854 --> 00:21:28,177
那东西会吵得我睡不着觉
Yeah, I-I really cannot sleep with that going on all night.

650
00:21:28,177 --> 00:21:29,573
复活节快乐
Happy Easter!

651
00:21:30,367 --> 00:21:31,946
-复活节快乐 -阿石 拿它做什么
- Happy Easter! - Rocky? What's that for?

652
00:21:31,946 --> 00:21:33,169
你知道做什么
You know what it's for.

653
00:21:34,728 --> 00:21:36,042
复活节快乐
Happy Easter!

654
00:21:37,957 --> 00:21:39,332
复活节快乐
Happy Easter!
